{"4352290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Testimony - Night Underground", "steam_appid": 4352290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimony</strong> is an episodic horror-thriller game anthology where each chapter tells a short story of people who have survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a testimony to tell, we’ll love you to share it with us in our official channels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re browsing the second installment of the “Testimony” anthology series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.poster.avif?t=1781128501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.webm?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.mp4?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Testimony: Night Underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandy, a shy 23-year-old girl, accompanies her friends Alice and Karen into the depths of a network of secret tunnels. What begins as a simple photo-taking adventure turns into a nightmare when, deep underground, an unexpected event unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Underground is a first-person walking simulator atmospheric experience where you can take pictures, talk with your 2 friends and receive text messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.poster.avif?t=1781128501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.webm?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.mp4?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school horror visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and place objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pictures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimony</strong> is an episodic horror-thriller game anthology where each chapter tells a short story of people who have survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a testimony to tell, we’ll love you to share it with us in our official channels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re browsing the second installment of the “Testimony” anthology series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.poster.avif?t=1781128501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.webm?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/bf722d4e34157f502e4133dfbdae0dc1.mp4?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Testimony: Night Underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandy, a shy 23-year-old girl, accompanies her friends Alice and Karen into the depths of a network of secret tunnels. What begins as a simple photo-taking adventure turns into a nightmare when, deep underground, an unexpected event unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Underground is a first-person walking simulator atmospheric experience where you can take pictures, talk with your 2 friends and receive text messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.poster.avif?t=1781128501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.webm?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/extras/9d7d89ee5bfa550ee51c971ef3a76619.mp4?t=1781128501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school horror visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and place objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pictures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Mandy, a shy 23-year-old girl, accompanies her friends Alice and Karen into the depths of a network of secret tunnels. What begins as a simple photo-taking adventure turns into a nightmare when, deep underground, an unexpected event unfolds.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4352290/9feb73a63d3a8644315aeeeb